      *################################################################*02700099
      * Control your database updates/queries from here. Use Perform   *02710099
      * statements to the different database parts that will be        *02720099
      * accessed in such a way that one section only controls update of*02730099
      * one database element.                                          *02740099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02750099
       G000-Update                       Section.                       02760099
           Evaluate True                                                02770099
                                                                        02780099
             When RTFCE100-B-Contract-No-I     = 'U'                    02790099
      *        .......CHANGE EXISTING CONTRACT.......                   02800099
                                                                        02810099
               Move  RTFCE100-B-Contract-No-D                           02820099
                                         To    Ws-Contract-No           02830099
      *        Change availability                                      02840099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Availability-I      = 'U'                 02850099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-Issued-Date-I       = 'U'                 02860099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-Confirmed-I         = 'U'                 02870099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-Silent-Confr-I      = 'U'                 02880099
      *            Update Main_Contract                                 02890099
                   Set  Wb-In-Work       To    True                     02900099
                   Perform H200-Read-Main-Contract                      02910099
                   Perform G100-Update-Main-Contract                    02920099
               End-If                                                   02930099
      *                                                                 02940099
      *        If  RTFCE100-I-Availability-I      = 'U'                 02950099
      *            Availability also affects Event_Info                 02960099
      *            Set Wb-EI-Type-Due    To    True                     02970099
      *            Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         02980099
      *            Evaluate True                                        02990099
      *              When RTFCE100-I-Availability-D      = 'S'          03000099
      *               And R7919999-Return-OK                            03010099
      *                Perform G600-Delete-Event-Info                   03020099
      *                                                                 03030099
      *              When (    RTFCE100-I-Availability-D = 'D'          03040099
      *                    Or  RTFCE100-I-Availability-D = 'A'          03050099
      *                    Or  RTFCE100-I-Availability-D = 'M')         03060099
      *               And R7919999-Return-OK                            03070099
      *                If  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I = 'U'                  03080099
      *                    Move  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D                  03090099
      *                                  To    Ws-Event-Date            03100099
      *                End-If                                           03110099
      *                Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   03120099
      *                                                                 03130099
      *              When (    RTFCE100-I-Availability-D = 'D'          03140099
      *                    Or  RTFCE100-I-Availability-D = 'A'          03150099
      *                    Or  RTFCE100-I-Availability-D = 'M')         03160099
      *               And R7919999-Return-Error                         03170099
      *                If  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I = 'U'                  03180099
      *                    Move  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D                  03190099
      *                                  To    Ws-Event-Date            03200099
      *                End-If                                           03210099
      *                Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   03220099
      *            End-Evaluate                                         03230099
      *        End-If                                                   03240099
                                                                        03250099
      *        Update Contract_Amount                                   03260099
               Perform H300-Read-Contract-Amount                        03270099
      * If the CA-currency has been changed, any registered charges     03280099
      * are to be deleted.                                              03290099
               If  RTFCE100-I-CC-Amount-I =    'U'                      03300099
                 If  RTFCE100-I-CC-Amount-D                             03310099
                                         Not = R115ICA0-Currency        03320099
                   Perform H600-Delete-Shadow-Charges                   03330099
                 End-If                                                 03340099
               End-If                                                   03350099
               Perform G300-Delete-Contract-Amount                      03360099
               Perform G400-Insert-Contract-Amount1                     03370099
      *                                                                 03380099
      *        Update Event_Info                                        03390099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-I    = 'U'                 03400099
                   Set Wb-EI-Type-Follow To    True                     03410099
                   Move RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-D                     03420099
                                         To     Ws-Event-Date           03430099
                   Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         03440099
                   If  R7919999-Return-OK                               03450099
                       Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   03460099
                   Else                                                 03470099
                       Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   03480099
                   End-If                                               03490099
               End-If                                                   03500099
                                                                        03510099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I          = 'U'                 03520099
                   And Not                                              03520199
                   RTFCE100-I-Contract-Type-D  = 'ILG'                  03520299
      *            And Not TF-Aut-Prov                                  03521099
      *        And RTFCE100-I-Availability-I  Not = 'U'                 03530099
                   Set Wb-EI-Type-Due    To    True                     03540099
                   Move RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D                           03550099
                                         To    Ws-Event-Date            03560099
                   Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         03570099
                   If  R7919999-Return-OK                               03580099
                       Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   03590099
                   Else                                                 03600099
                       Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   03610099
                   End-If                                               03620099
               End-If                                                   03630099
      *                                                                 03640099
      *        Feilretting 23.11.00                                     03650099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Operation-Type-D = 'REGISTER'             03660099
               And (RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I          = 'U'                03670099
               Or   RTFCE100-I-Tenor-I             = 'U')               03680099
               And RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-I Not = 'U'                03690099
                   Set Wb-EI-Type-Follow                                03700099
                                         To    True                     03710099
                   Perform H500-Calc-Follow-Up-Date                     03720099
                   Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         03730099
                   If  R7919999-Return-OK                               03740099
                       Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   03750099
                   Else                                                 03760099
                       Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   03770099
                   End-If                                               03780099
               End-If                                                   03790099
      *                                                                 03800099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Tenor-I             = 'U'                 03810099
                   And Not                                              03810199
                   RTFCE100-I-Contract-Type-D  = 'ILG'                  03810299
      *            And Not TF-Aut-Prov                                  03811099
      *        And RTFCE100-I-Availability-I  Not = 'U'                 03820099
                   Set Wb-EI-Type-Due    To    True                     03830099
                   Move 00010101         To    Ws-Event-Date            03840099
                   Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         03850099
                   If  R7919999-Return-OK                               03860099
                       Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   03870099
                   Else                                                 03880099
                       Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   03890099
                   End-If                                               03900099
               End-If                                                   03910099
                                                                        03920099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-I       = 'U'                 03930099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-Place-Of-Expiry-I   = 'U'                 03940099
                   Set Wb-EI-Type-Expiry To    True                     03950099
                   If  RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-I = 'U'                   03960099
                       Move RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-D                    03970099
                                         To    Ws-Event-Date            03980099
                   Else                                                 03990099
                       Move  00010101    To    Ws-Event-Date            04000099
                   End-If                                               04010099
                                                                        04020099
                   Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         04030099
                   If  R7919999-Return-OK                               04040099
                       Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   04050099
                   Else                                                 04060099
                       Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   04070099
                   End-If                                               04080099
               End-If                                                   04090099
      *                                                                 04091099
      * New logic 2014.03.19 KR TF-AutProv                              04092099
      *                                                                 04093099
      *                                                                 04094099
      *        If  RTFCE100-I-Contract-Type-D  = 'ILG'                  04094199
      *        And     RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I          = 'U'             04094299
      *        And     RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D          = 99991231        04094399
      *            Set Wb-EI-Type-Prov-DT To True                       04094499
      *            Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         04094599
      *            If  R7919999-Return-OK                               04094699
      *                Perform G600-Delete-Event-Info                   04094799
      *            End-If                                               04094899
      *        End-If                                                   04094999
      *                                                                 04095099
               If  TF-Aut-Prov                                          04095199
                   Set Wb-EI-Type-Prov-DT To True                       04096099
                   If  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I = 'U'                      04096199
                       Move  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D                      04096299
                                         To Ws-Event-Date               04096399
                   Else                                                 04096499
                       Move  00010101    To Ws-Event-Date               04096599
                   End-If                                               04096699
                   Perform H400-Read-Event-Info                         04099099
                   If  R7919999-Return-OK                               04099199
                       Perform G800-Update-Event-Info                   04099299
                   Else                                                 04099399
                       Perform G700-Insert-Event-Info                   04099499
                   End-If                                               04099599
               End-If                                                   04099699
                                                                        04100099
             When RTFCE100-B-Contract-No-I Not = 'U'                    04110099
      *         .......CREATE NEW CONTRACT.......                       04120099
                                                                        04130099
      *        Create Main_Contract                                     04140099
               Perform H100-Create-Contract-No                          04150099
      *                                                                 04160099
               Set  Wb-In-Actual         To    True                     04170099
               Perform G200-Insert-Main-Contract                        04180099
               Set  Wb-In-Work           To    True                     04190099
               Perform G200-Insert-Main-Contract                        04200099
      *                                                                 04210099
      *        Create Contract_Amount                                   04220099
               If  RTFCE100-I-Orig-Amount-I       = 'U'                 04230099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-CC-Amount-I         = 'U'                 04240099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-Max-Pst-Tolerance-I = 'U'                 04250099
               Or  RTFCE100-I-Min-Pst-Tolerance-I = 'U'                 04260099
                   Perform G500-Insert-Contract-Amount2                 04270099
               End-If                                                   04280099
