               Move  'H511'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        10990099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11000099
           End-If                                                       11010099
      *                                                                 11020099
           Evaluate True                                                11030099
             When R7919090-Ut-Bank-Dag                                  11040099
               If  R7919090-Ut-Dgr-Neste-Bankdag > 1                    11050099
               and RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I        = 'U'                   11060099
                 Initialize                    R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager11070099
                 Set   R7919010-Versjon  To    True                     11080099
                 Move  Ws-Event-Date     To    R7919010-In-Dato         11090099
                 Compute  Ws-Add-Days   =                               11100099
                 ( R7919090-Ut-Dgr-Neste-Bankdag +                      11110099
                   R7919090-Ut-Dgr-Forr-Bankdag - 2)  * -1              11120099
                 If Ws-Add-Days < 0                                     11130099
                    Move  Ws-Add-Days    To    R7919010-In-Adder-Dag    11140099
                    Call  'F7919010'     Using R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager11150099
                                               R7919999-Error           11160099
                    End-Call                                            11170099
                    If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                           11180099
                        Move  'X570'       To    R7919999-Paragraf      11190099
                        Perform Z900-Abend                              11200099
                    End-If                                              11210099
                    Move  R7919010-Ut-Dato To    Ws-Event-Date          11220099
                 End-If                                                 11230099
               End-If                                                   11240099
             When R7919090-Ut-Ikke-Bank-Dag                             11250099
