               Set   R7919010-Versjon    To    True                     11270099
               Move  Ws-Event-Date       To    R7919010-In-Dato         11280099
               Compute  Ws-Add-Days   =                                 11290099
               ( R7919090-Ut-Dgr-Neste-Bankdag +                        11300099
                 R7919090-Ut-Dgr-Forr-Bankdag - 1)  * -1                11310099
               Move  Ws-Add-Days         To    R7919010-In-Adder-Dag    11320099
               Call  'F7919010'          Using R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager11330099
                                           R7919999-Error               11340099
               End-Call                                                 11350099
               If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                11360099
