      *################################################################*12150099
      * Perform your move of data fields that must be delivered back   *12160099
      * from this module here.                                         *12170099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*12180099
       U000-Out-Fields                   Section.                       12190099
      *                                                                 12200099
           If  RTFCE100-I-Operation-Type-D = 'ADVICE              '     12210099
           Or  RTFCE100-I-Operation-Type-D = 'PRE-ADVICE          '     12220099
           Or  RTFCE100-I-Operation-Type-D = 'ISSUE               '     12230099
               Perform H300-Read-Contract-Amount                        12240099
               Compute Ws-Max-Amount                                    12250099
                   =   ( R115ICA0-Original-Amount                       12260099
                         * R115ICA0-Max-Pct-Tolerance ) / 100           12270099
                   +     R115ICA0-Original-Amount                       12280099
               End-Compute                                              12290099
                                                                        12300099
               Move 'U'                  To RTFCE100-O-Calc-Max-Amount-O12310099
               Move Ws-Max-Amount        To RTFCE100-O-Calc-Max-Amount-D12320099
           End-If                                                       12330099
